{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-junbright-ltd-vittanly-gaming-chair-sold-via-amazon-and-aliexpress-2607-0300","content_id":"4a141619-56bd-477b-8dc1-d2a2b8bad929","description":"Product Recall for Junbright Ltd Vittanly Gaming Chair presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d4654578-21bf-4219-aa84-aa628e3938fb","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-11T15:30:13+01:00","id":"d4654578-21bf-4219-aa84-aa628e3938fb","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-11T15:30:13+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7b31f5114277b327805c20/2607-0300-product-recall-vittanly-gaming-chairs.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Junbright Ltd Vittanly Gaming Chair sold via Amazon and AliExpress</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire because the cover fabric and sheet foam does not meet flammability requirements.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Junbright Ltd.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Furniture - Household/Office Chairs/Stools (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Junbright Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Name</td>\n      <td>Vittanly Gaming Chair</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model Numbers</td>\n      <td>DJY002BK (Black) &amp; DJY003WT (White)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Black and white models of faux leather gaming chair, supplied in black cardboard packaging.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d4654578-21bf-4219-aa84-aa628e3938fb\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7b31f5114277b327805c20/2607-0300-product-recall-vittanly-gaming-chairs.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product’s cover fabric and sheet foam failed the flammability requirements of Schedule 5 Part 1 of the Furniture and Furnishings (Fire) (Safety) Regulations 1988 (as amended). In the event of exposure to an ignition source, the furniture may ignite and burn more readily, increasing the risk of fire and resulting in serious injuries or fatalities.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Furniture and Furnishings (Fire) (Safety) Regulations 1988.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Junbright Ltd.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately, and contact the distributor they purchased from for instructions on return of the product and refund/redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2607-0300</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-11T14:41:24Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"furniture","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-11","product_risk_level":"medium"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-11T15:41:24+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-junbright-ltd-vittanly-gaming-chair-sold-via-amazon-and-aliexpress-2607-0300","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-junbright-ltd-vittanly-gaming-chair-sold-via-amazon-and-aliexpress-2607-0300","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-junbright-ltd-vittanly-gaming-chair-sold-via-amazon-and-aliexpress-2607-0300","content_id":"4a141619-56bd-477b-8dc1-d2a2b8bad929","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-11T14:41:24Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Junbright Ltd Vittanly Gaming Chair sold via Amazon and AliExpress (2607-0300)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-junbright-ltd-vittanly-gaming-chair-sold-via-amazon-and-aliexpress-2607-0300","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are","short_name":"Risk